6. ControlScreen rewrite (remove circular joystick → D-pad + 2 faders + sweep buttons + pan matrix L/Mid/R/Lados + distance measure sheet + walkie + agent panel)
7. RoutingMapScreen: Control Center + tappable outputs + output detail sheet
8. MainActivity permission banner + ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION; Manifest ACCESS_NOTIFICATION_POLICY
